g neon skyscrapers, bridge stay-cables, tunnel laser arches, and the car's crimson tail/brake glow** right on the road!\\n   - **5 MONUMENTAL SPIDER-VERSE SET-PIECES**:\\n     * `canyon_grid` \\u0026 `eau_rouge_climb`: Dense `50–220 m` comic skyscrapers `11–38 m` right beside the barriers (lit halftone window grids + vertical neon signs + overhead viaduct arches + giant glowing Spider-Verse horizon moon/portal behind the `+42 m` Eau-Rouge crest!);\\n     * `sky_bridge` \\u0026 `banked_bowl_plunge`: Under-deck steel box girders + two monumental `115 m` H-pylon suspension towers with glowing cyan/gold stay-cable fans + outer curved neon glass banking wall on the `18°` bowl + dark reflective harbor water plane at `Z = -5 m` below!\\n     * `strobe_tunnel_harbor`: Enclosed 450m dark vaulted tunnel shell (`tunnel == true`) lined every `12 m` with blazing crimson/cyan hexagonal light ribs (high-speed light strobing on car!) + Harbor Hairpin neon gantries!\\n     * **Faux-Volumetric God-Ray Light Blades**: Translucent Fresnel-faded additive light shafts slicing through the skyscraper canyon \\u0026 tunnel exit (`~0.02s` CPU cost, massive cinema depth!).\\n   - **HIGH-IMPACT 3D CAR FX (`V6_09_ComicFX`)**: Keep your `NG_SV_ComicSurface` (halftones + hatching + electric cyan/magenta rim kicks) \\u0026 `Solidify` hero ink outlines, AND add **Twin Exhaust Afterburner Shock-Diamonds**, **Golden Titanium Floor-Plank Spark Streaks** (for uphill compression \\u0026 \\u003e300 km/h bumps!), **Rear-Wing Helical Vortex Ribbons**, and **Wet-Tire Neon Rooster-Tail Spray Arcs**!\\n\\n2) **`@anim` (`pipeline/v6_sv_comp.py`, `v6_sv_stills.py`, `render_v6_sv.py` -\\u003e `v6_spiderverse/v6_stage_anim_sv.blend`, `1,281` frames / `24` Extreme Blockbuster Shots)**:\\n   - **Full 3D Rig Attitude (`XYZ + Heading + Pitch + Bank Roll`)**: Drive `Bone_Root` along `(racing_xy, racing_z + 0.012 * cos(bank))` and orient car smoothly to match 3D track tangent (`heading`, `pitch`) + `bank_deg` roll! Kee